## 6. Bot Types (BotConstants)

| Type | Behaviors | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Scav | Patrol+Chase+Shoot | Pistol, 80HP, vision 25m, Helmet_Basic |
| PMC | Patrol+Chase+Shoot+Heal+Dodge+ThrowGrenade | Rifle, full kit (helmet+armor), 100HP, vision 35m |
| Boss | Chase+Shoot+Dodge | Shotgun, 200HP, vision 40m, body armor |
| Target / TargetWeak / TargetPatrol / TargetFast / TargetDodge | None / Patrol / Dodge | 10000HP test dummies (or 50HP TargetWeak), vision 0 |
| TargetLightArmor / TargetHeavyArmor / TargetGlassCannon / TargetTank | None | Armored test dummies |
| TargetKillFeel{10/25/50/75/100} | None / Patrol / Fast / Helmet | Low-HP for ragdoll iteration |
| **Zombie** | Chase+MeleeAttack | 70HP, vision 999/360°, melee 12dmg/1.6m/1s. Pistol mesh placeholder |
| **RangedTarget** | Chase+Shoot | Streamlined PMC — vision 70m, engage 50m, no grenade/heal/dodge. Helmet_Basic |

---

## 7. Blackboard (BotEntityState.Blackboard, 24 fields)

Target: `TargetEId`, `LastKnownTargetPos`, `HasTarget`, `CanSeeTarget`, `DistanceToTarget`, `TimeSinceTargetSeen`. Patrol: `PatrolWaypoints`, `PatrolWaypointIndex`, `PatrolWaitTimer`. Timers: `ReactionTimer`, `DodgeCooldownTimer`, `HealCooldownTimer`, `GrenadeCooldownTimer`, `MeleeAttackCooldownTimer`, `PerceptionTimer`, `GrenadeThrowDelayTimer`. State: `IsDodging`, `DodgeDirection`, `DodgeTimer`. Consumables: `MedkitsRemaining`, `GrenadesRemaining`. Alerts: `WasDamaged`, `LastDamageTime`. Debug: `RunningNodeId`, `DebugStatus`, `Trace`.

